OL,3,AFrench police arrest 135 people, as
OL,4,Atens of thousands protest across
OL,5,Acountry
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrance's interior minister says that
OL,8,F135 people have been arrested as tens
OL,9,Fof thousands join protests across the
OL,10,Fcountry
OL,12,FPolice in Paris earlier seized weapons
OL,13,Fand gas masks in a crackdown; in a
OL,14,Fsocial media post, they say "all is
OL,15,Fcalm" in the city
OL,17,FToday's marches follow last weekend's
OL,18,Friots and looting that impacted
OL,19,Fthousands of businesses and saw more
OL,20,Fthan 2,700 arrested
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
