OL,5,Acountry
OL,6,
OL,7,FCurfews, closures and protest bans are
OL,8,Fin place in cities including Paris,
OL,9,FMarseille and Lyon - although some
OL,10,Fdemonstrations are being allowed
OL,12,FOne protester in Paris tells the BBC:
OL,13,F"We're now protesting for our right to
OL,14,Fprotest"
